  triage:description "quality-mgr qa-pr1310-r8 (PR #1310, AY.15 herdr-name-uniqueness, head 715ab21ea; report: PR #1310 issuecomment 5576239134). arch-qa ARCH-003. crates/atm-core/src/service_runtime.rs is about 1059 non-test lines, over the 1000-line decomposition threshold; this sprint added the RetainedServiceRuntime::resolve_roster_member_at_ingress trait method and LocalServiceRuntime implementation (lines 301-312 and 704-726). Overage is modest (about 60 lines). Correction: move a cohesive unit (for example the roster-member resolution logic) into its own module so the file returns under the threshold, with no behavior change." ;
